    "Banners that macOS shows appear here while the hub is on. Nothing is stored." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "cs" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bannery, které macOS zobrazuje, se tady objeví, dokud je centrum zapnuté. Nic se neukládá."
